# Stack

**Recommended:** [Astro](https://astro.build) — static HTML, content
collections, minimal client JS.

## Layout

```
src/
  content/posts/          # MDX + frontmatter (see content.mdc)
  styles/
    tokens.css            # from handoff/tokens.css
    components.css        # from handoff/reference/styles.css
  components/             # Mast, Post, ArchiveRow, …
  layouts/                # Base.astro, PageWithSidebar.astro
  pages/                  # index, archive, feed.xml.ts
handoff/                  # design spec + reference HTML (canonical UI)
```

## Integrations

`@astrojs/mdx`, `@astrojs/sitemap`, RSS/Atom for `/feed.xml`

## Build

- `output: 'static'`
- `trailingSlash: 'never'`
- Canonical URL in `astro.config.mjs`

## Don't add (v1)

- Client router, analytics, comments, search UI library, Tailwind without
  token mapping
